    {
      "id": "sol.hmmt-nov-theme-2013-p7.hmmt",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "\\(200203-2013 \\equiv 3(\\bmod 4)\\), so the last digit is 3 ; now \\(\\frac{-2013-3}{-4}=504 \\equiv 0\\), so the next digit (to the left) is 0 ; then \\(\\frac{504-0}{-4}=-126 \\equiv 2 ; \\frac{-126-2}{-4}=32 \\equiv 0 ; \\frac{32-0}{-4}=-8 \\equiv 0 ; \\frac{-8-0}{-4}=2\\).\nThus \\(-2013_{10}=200203_{-4}\\).",
